 "title": "Sales Team Script Cheat Sheet",
 "topic": "sales",
 "summary": "Alex Hormozi outlines a cheat sheet of sales scripts tailored to specific lead interaction scenarios. He explains which script to use depending on whether a lead books a call, misses a call, runs out of time, no-shows, or buys.",
 "key_points": [
  "Call set script: Call the lead immediately after they book a call.",
  "Text set script: Use when the prospect does not pick up the initial call.",
  "BAMFAM script: Use when you run out of time on a call and the prospect has not bought yet.",
  "No show script: Use when a prospect misses the call and does not answer a double dial.",
  "Referral script: Use when a prospect buys or is closed, but you ran out of time to ask for referrals on the call.",
  "📝 On-screen text saved: [0:00] Text shown on screen: SALES TEAM SCRIPT CHEAT SHEET [0:03] Text shown on screen: Call Set Script SETTING CALL SCR"
 ],
 "content": "Post text: Comment “SALES” to get the free $100M Sales Teams Training.\n\nTranscript:\nRemember, when someone books a call with you, call them right away and then use the call set script. When they don't pick up your call, use the text set script. When you run out of time on the call and they haven't bought yet, use the BAMFAM script. When they don't show up and don't answer your double dial, use the no show script. And when someone buys or you close them but ran out of time to ask, use the referral script. Steal this, and if you want the rest, comment sales to get it.\n\nText on screen:\n- SALES TEAM SCRIPT CHEAT SHEET\n- Call Set Script\n- Text Set Script\n- BAMFAM Script\n- No Show Script\n- Referral Script\n- ACQUISITION.COM\n\n--- On-screen text ---\n[0:00] Text shown on screen:\nSALES TEAM\nSCRIPT CHEAT SHEET\n\n[0:03] Text shown on screen:\nCall Set Script\n\nSETTING CALL SCRIPT:\nFirst Name:\n\"Hey [FIRST NAME], this is [YOUR NAME] from Acquisition.com, how's it going?\"\nReaction/Fill:\n\"Saw you opted in for [unclear] - I've got 5 minutes to see what you need help with. Have you got a quick second to chat?\"\nReaction/Fill:\n\"Awesome, so tell me a bit about your business, [FIRST NAME]? What kind of business do you have right now?\"\nIF They Don't Have Time:\n\"No problem, let's schedule a call for 15 minutes. Does 11am tomorrow work or would 3pm be better?\"\n\n[0:06] Text shown on screen:\nText Set Script\n\nSETTING TEXT SCRIPT: (If they don't pick up)\nText #1:\n\"Hey [FIRST NAME] - it's [YOUR NAME] with Acquisition.com!\"\nText #2:\n\"saw you opted in for a call about your business... what kind of business do you have right now?\"\nText #3:\n\"Or are you just getting started?\"\nText #4:\n\"No worries if you're super busy right now - I can also send over a quick calendar link if that's easier?\"\n\n[0:10] Text shown on screen:\nBAMFAM Script\n\nCLOSE CALL BAMFAM:\n\"I can see you're running short on time and I want to respect that. Would it be okay if we picked this up tomorrow?\"\nReaction/Fill:\n\"Great! Let's get a time on the calendar right now while we're both here so it's locked in. Does [TIME] or [TIME] work better for you?\"\nReaction/Fill:\n\"Perfect, I've got you down for [DAY/TIME]. Before we jump off, what's the #1 thing you want to make sure we cover on that call?\"\n\n[0:14] Text shown on screen:\nNo Show Script\n\nNO SHOW SCRIPT:\nText #1: (Send right after missed call)\n\"Hey [FIRST NAME] - missed you on our call just now! Everything okay?\"\nText #2: (5 min later)\n\"Hey - still free for a quick chat or should we reschedule for tomorrow?\"\nText #3: (10 min later)\n\"Hey [FIRST NAME] - no worries, looks like something came up. I'll shoot over a link to reschedule when you have a sec!\"\n\n[0:15] Text shown on screen:\nReferral Script\n[unclear]",
